---
import CadenzaLayout from "../../../layouts/CadenzaLayout.astro";
---

<CadenzaLayout title="About | Cadenza Studio" description="Built by a teacher, not around one. Learn about Cadenza Studio.">






  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Built by a teacher, not around one.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Story -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Story</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Cadenza Studio didn't start as a business plan — it started as a working teacher's spreadsheet, calendar, and phone full of parent texts, teacher contacts, and leads. Today it runs the same studio it was built for, and its next step is a first pilot alongside other music teachers.</p>

        <h3 style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Meet the Founder</h3>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
          <img
            src="/images/cadenza/headshot.jpg"
            alt="Jeremy Sheeshka — CEO & Founder of Cadenza Studio"
            style="width: 160px; height: 160px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; flex-shrink: 0; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);"
          />
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text-secondary);"><strong>Jeremy Sheeshka — CEO & Founder.</strong> Jeremy is a K-12 music educator and MET student at UBC who is passionate about jazz guitar and educational technology. He is fascinated by building software, and learning about open-source technologies, which led to him to create Cadenza Studio after losing many evenings to inefficient paperwork and administrative processes.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 2.5rem; padding: 1.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb); border-radius: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-surface, #f9fafb);">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Funding the pilot</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Cadenza's next step is a validated pilot of 8–10 paying studios. We are raising $90,000 CAD pre-seed (15% equity) to get there, with retention and hours-saved metrics by month 12.</p>
          <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th style="text-align: left; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Use of funds</th>
                <th style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Share</th>
                <th style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Amount</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Engineering (Cadenza + local RAG core)</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">55%</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">$49,500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Pilot hardware and onboarding</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">15%</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">$13,500</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Privacy and legal review</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">10%</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">$9,000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">Founder runway, 12 months</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">20%</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #e5e7eb);">$18,000</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="font-weight: 600;">
                <td style="padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;">Total</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;">100%</td>
                <td style="text-align: right; padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;">$90,000</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Our Mission -->
  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Our Mission</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 1.25rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--color-text);">To give music teachers back the hours spreadsheets and text threads were quietly taking, one studio at a time.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; margin-top: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <a href="/cadenza/features" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">See what Cadenza Studio can do</a>
          <a href="/cadenza/contact" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Join our community of music teachers</h2>
      <p>Start using Cadenza Studio today and see the difference it makes.</p>
      <a href="/cadenza-app" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">Get Started Free</a>
    </div>
  </section>



</CadenzaLayout>
